# Copy to .env and fill in what you want. .env is gitignored and never committed.
# Every key here is optional. They are read only by the serverless functions in
# api/, so they stay out of the browser bundle. Note there is no VITE_ prefix,
# deliberately: Vite only exposes VITE_ variables to the client, so a plain name
# cannot reach the bundle even by mistake.
#
# Local dev only. On Vercel these are set in Project -> Settings -> Environment
# Variables, and `vercel dev` (without --local) pulls them from there.

# Optional. Enables the ground view preview on a position card, which fetches
# real Google Street View imagery for that spot. Without it the app works
# normally and the card explains that ground view is off.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional. Enables the better venue search through api/search.ts.
# A default public token from https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/ is enough;
# its default public scopes cover the Search Box API. Without this, search falls
# back to Nominatim and Photon and the app still works.
MAPBOX_TOKEN=
